You can do something like:

apply(umdf@y,1,max,na.rm=T) / sum(which(!is.na <http://is.na>(apply(umdf@y,1,max,na.rm=T))))

the numerator gives you wether a site had at least one detection
the denominator is the number of sites (removing the NAs) - or could
be replaced by 111 if all sites were sampled.

Jorge

